{"asset_key":"ep9/quest_story_19108270","episode":"ep9","category":"quest_story","story_id":"19108270","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1910827001:1":{"text":"喂，艾菲拉——！该死，为什么她听不到咱的声音？！那不是咱！","source_cn":"喂，艾菲拉——！该死，为什么她听不到咱的声音？！那不是咱！","status":"hash_not_found","hash_xxh64":"0x260FA03B3D88AD5F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1910827002:1":{"text":"见鬼……这到底是怎么一回事？！咱明明就在这里，刚刚和艾...","source_cn":"见鬼……这到底是怎么一回事？！咱明明就在这里，刚刚和艾...","status":"truncated_preview","hash_xxh64":"","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:3:1910827002":{"text":"见鬼……这到底是怎么一回事？！咱明明就在这里，刚刚和艾菲拉说话的又是什么东西？！","source_cn":"见鬼……这到底是怎么一回事？！咱明明就在这里，刚刚和艾菲拉说话的又是什么东西？！","status":"hash_not_found","hash_xxh64":"0x2A40FBB73C3942AE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1910827003:1":{"text":"记忆中的对话、被奥汐娜扭曲的幻象……再联系你们在进入这...","source_cn":"记忆中的对话、被奥汐娜扭曲的幻象……再联系你们在进入这...","status":"truncated_preview","hash_xxh64":"","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1910827004:1":{"text":"在与奥汐娜接触的瞬间，你们被判断为需要被同化的“碎片”...","source_cn":"在与奥汐娜接触的瞬间，你们被判断为需要被同化的“碎片”...","status":"truncated_preview","hash_xxh64":"","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1910827005:1":{"text":"这里是<style=highlight>意识空间</s...","source_cn":"这里是<style=highlight>意识空间</s...","status":"truncated_preview","hash_xxh64":"","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1910827006:1":{"text":"而刚刚你们看到的，恐怕就是奥汐娜同化海裔，侵蚀艾菲拉记...","source_cn":"而刚刚你们看到的，恐怕就是奥汐娜同化海裔，侵蚀艾菲拉记...","status":"truncated_preview","hash_xxh64":"","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:8:1910827006":{"text":"而刚刚你们看到的，恐怕就是奥汐娜同化海裔，侵蚀艾菲拉记忆、消解她意识的过程……","source_cn":"而刚刚你们看到的，恐怕就是奥汐娜同化海裔，侵蚀艾菲拉记忆、消解她意识的过程……","status":"hash_not_found","hash_xxh64":"0x44B63C2179A0CA6E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1910827007:1":{"text":"呸，她休想！","source_cn":"呸，她休想！","status":"hash_not_found","hash_xxh64":"0x79D63C4ECBAA6602","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1910827008:1":{"text":"艾菲拉呢？老大，那家伙……她不会就这么认输的，对不对？","source_cn":"艾菲拉呢？老大，那家伙……她不会就这么认输的，对不对？","status":"hash_not_found","hash_xxh64":"0xB937C30677A614BE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1910827009:1":{"text":"你抬起头，望向远处那个正闪烁着微弱光芒的奇异光球。","source_cn":"你抬起头，望向远处那个正闪烁着微弱光芒的奇异光球。","status":"hash_not_found","hash_xxh64":"0x2B53A5299667CA7F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1910827010:1":{"text":"最开始，它只是由一颗记忆水晶化作的小小光点，在你们的呼...","source_cn":"最开始，它只是由一颗记忆水晶化作的小小光点，在你们的呼...","status":"truncated_preview","hash_xxh64":"","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1910827011:1":{"text":"当你们令记忆重现时，记忆消失后化作的光芒便会涌入它的体...","source_cn":"当你们令记忆重现时，记忆消失后化作的光芒便会涌入它的体...","status":"truncated_preview","hash_xxh64":"","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:14:1910827011":{"text":"当你们令记忆重现时，记忆消失后化作的光芒便会涌入它的体内，令它愈发完整……如今，即便相隔甚远，你也能看清它为你们指明的道路。","source_cn":"当你们令记忆重现时，记忆消失后化作的光芒便会涌入它的体内，令它愈发完整……如今，即便相隔甚远，你也能看清它为你们指明的道路。","status":"hash_not_found","hash_xxh64":"0xA56A6B8938B71FEC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1910827012:1":{"text":"这么说……那个光球越完整，艾菲拉的意识就会越清晰？意识...","source_cn":"这么说……那个光球越完整，艾菲拉的意识就会越清晰？意识...","status":"truncated_preview","hash_xxh64":"","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":""